  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling-up actions to tackle air pollution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the local authorities in five pilot municipalities in North Macedonia to detect and measure sources of air pollution, identify and plan proper measures to address the problems, and implement mitigation activities, along with a horizontal prevention activity of raising public awareness and facilitating behavioral change. The project will be built on the results achieved and lessons learnt from the first project phase and will aim at scaling up and replication of the conce</narrative>
  </description>
